lemma enRoute (hstrong: StrongR2 H x lP C b₀ o r p₀) (hb:∀ i,0<r i) (ht: Menu.Offer o b₀ r (Q x).p.B ((Q x).p.supportExponent-4) u₀) (hl:lP ≤ J)
    (hΩ:2*ϕ*v₁ ≤ pz)(hz:H! ≤ p₀): GardenCameo H x lP C b₀ o r ψ Ξ p₀ pz (2*θ*v₁):= by
   let Z:= houseS H x; let t:=(v₁); let Fε := (u'); let Gx:= numericWidth (m:=m) (R:=R) lP hR hl t hv.leftB.le -- arguments check
   have hR':=hk _ _ (A.B.valid.pays m) _ (step_paid A.B.a m); have hs:= Z.laws.data.funds
   have ha:= hR'.2 ⟨(F').patch,hs.funds.kernel,hs.length_eq,hs.funds.atStep⟩ lP hl
   have hF:(B).order=(X.p.profile Jp).order:= congr_arg RG.Stage.order (params_eq A.B.valid m); have hn:(B).power=(X.p.profile Jp).power:= congr_arg RG.Stage.power (params_eq A.B.valid m); rw [← hF, ← hn] at ha
   have hx : tx=betaF G y L:= beta_eq A.B.valid m
   have hy : (B).supportExponent+3 ≤ (Ze).earn:= by
        have he':= R.pledging.agenda _ _ (step_paid A.B.a m)|>.1; rw [Rain.jersey (A:=A) (m:=m)|>.2.2.1]; linarith
   have hr(i): (b₀ i).s.val.image ((F').ratio.parent ∘ o) ⊆ (M' i).crest.image (F').ratio.parent:=by intro j hj; obtain ⟨i',hi,hj⟩:= mem_image.mp hj; subst j; exact mem_image_of_mem _ (ht.sites _ (mem_image_of_mem _ hi))
   have hX'(i): GridApprox.Nil.Scoped {xΩ| o₀ xΩ∈ (M' i).crest.image (F').ratio.parent} (M₁ i):= GridApprox.Nil.scope_send _ _ _ ((Accent.room _ _ _).2 (hr i))
   have hY:= hstrong.plot
   obtain ⟨hp,hf⟩:= H.knows x x.2
   obtain ⟨s',ha0,hv0,hx0⟩:= Reel.blend_it hv; have hK:= hv.stamps s'; rw [hx0] at hK
   obtain ⟨T',hT⟩:= Opera.partial_feature A.B R.shape hm R.pledging.conducts.full R.pledging.conducts.income (show PartialLives A.B.bake N (m+1) n (Reel.bend (Q x) ψ) from ⟨hp.path,hp.point,hp.clip,hK⟩) hf
   have hS:= Opera.protocol A.B hm R.pledging.conducts.full (n:=n)
   have hN(i): Marker.Poly.price r (M₁ i) ≤1:= Menu.paid (b₀ i) hb
   have hU (f:∀ i:(W).fragrances, Finset (Booking W M' lP i)) (i:ℕ)(hp:i ≤ lP +1)(hF:∀ k j,j∈ f k → i ≤ ranked W M' lP k j):
        scout! (answering W O M' M₀ C M₁ lP f (Ξ.plug W ψ lP)) (tx^requested i (u'/2)) ∧ ((∀ k j,j∈ f k→ ranked W M' lP k j ≤ lP) → scout! (chef W O M' M₀ C M₁ lP f ψ-answering W O M' M₀ C M₁ lP f (Ξ.plug W ψ lP)) H!) := by
     have hv:= Orbit.fringe W O M' M₀ hY C M₁ lP r hb hN o₀ hX' (B) rfl rfl f ψ T' (Ze) Ξ hy ha hS hp hF
     rw [hx]; exact hv
   let Fc:= fun i=> apportion W M' lP i (fun t=> if true=true then ¬ lP+1 ≤t else lP+1 ≤t)
   obtain ⟨hS',hb'⟩:= hU Fc 0 (Nat.zero_le _) (fun i j he=> Nat.zero_le _)
   have hV:= coherent hm H x lP C b₀ o r ψ hv hR hstrong hb ht hl hΩ
   have hg:= hb' (fun i j he=> by unfold Fc apportion at he; simpa [Nat.lt_add_one_iff] using he)
   rw [hx] at hS'; exact ⟨hV,incomeOn W O M' M₀ C M₁ lP r hb o₀ Pt g' ψ Ξ hV.parts hS' (opened W C r o₀ hg hz),hU⟩
